# 06_swamp_boostballguardian, an ordinary Sporb u041b (top u041c, grabber u041d; its power bomb guardian
# flag is 0 on disc): woken, shooting, stage messages, scan visor, hurt top (flinch, fake death).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/sporb.py <out>
#   3dfd2249,06_swamp_boostballguardian --con tools/cov/specs/sporb_undertemple.con --fast --frames 2800
@f300 god 1; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; give powerBomb 5; give missile 50
@f305 obj u041b; status
@f310 place u041b player 14
@f320 send u041b Activate; send u041b Alert; fsm u041b WakeUp
@f400 obj u041b; status
@f420 fsm u041b Attack
@f425 fsm u041b Fire
@f700 obj u041b
@f800 send u041b Increment
@f820 fsm u041b Attack
@f825 fsm u041b Fire
@f1100 send u041b Increment
@f1120 fsm u041b Attack
@f1125 fsm u041b Fire
@f1400 send u041b Decrement
@f1500 visor scan
@f1600 visor combat
@f1700 damage u041c 1
@f1900 damage u041c 2000
@f2200 obj u041b; obj u041c
@f2400 fsm u041b Flinch
@f2700 obj u041b; status
